Rule 1 (x tensor must not have bool dtype)
{v_1: tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≠ 0
>>
Rule 2 (y tensor must not have bool dtype)
{v_2: tensor} |= dtype_(v_2) ≠ 0
>>
Rule 3 (x tensor must have allowed numeric dtype)
{v_1: tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≥ 1 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 10
>>
Rule 4 (y tensor must have allowed numeric dtype)
{v_2: tensor} |= dtype_(v_2) ≥ 1 ∧ dtype_(v_2) ≤ 10
>>
Rule 5 (x and y tensors must have matching dtypes)
{v_1: tensor, v_2: tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) = dtype_(v_2)
>>
Rule 6 (tensors with same rank must have broadcastable shapes)
{v_1: tensor, v_2: tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2) then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1]: shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i) ∨ shape(v_1, i) = 1 ∨ shape(v_2, i) = 1
>>
Rule 7 (x tensor dtype must be in valid range for pow operation)
{v_1: tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) = 1 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 2 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 3 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 4 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 6 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 7 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 8 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 9 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 10
>>
Rule 8 (y tensor dtype must be in valid range for pow operation)
{v_2: tensor} |= dtype_(v_2) = 1 ∨ dtype_(v_2) = 2 ∨ dtype_(v_2) = 3 ∨ dtype_(v_2) = 4 ∨ dtype_(v_2) = 6 ∨ dtype_(v_2) = 7 ∨ dtype_(v_2) = 8 ∨ dtype_(v_2) = 9 ∨ dtype_(v_2) = 10
>>
Rule 9 (x tensor must have integer, float, or complex dtype)
{v_1: tensor} |= (1 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 5) ∨ (6 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 10)
>>
Rule 10 (y tensor must have integer, float, or complex dtype)
{v_2: tensor} |= (1 ≤ dtype_(v_2) ∧ dtype_(v_2) ≤ 5) ∨ (6 ≤ dtype_(v_2) ∧ dtype_(v_2) ≤ 10)
